<ProjectLayout slug="random-box">
  <p>
    Movement does not necessarily lead somewhere.<br />
    We run, accelerate, endure, and eventually adapt.<br />
    Sometimes the body learns to withstand<br />
     what at first seems unbearable.
  </p>

  <p>
   Information moves differently.<br />
   It spreads, multiplies, and passes through us<br />
   faster than we can grasp it.<br />
    Still, we keep looking, searching, and reaching<br />
    for what lies beyond what we already know.
  </p>

  <p>
  Perhaps there is always something<br />
   that should remain closed.<br /> 
  But knowing that only makes us want to open it.
  </p>

